      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 502478478,
          "type": null,
          "body": "And don't worry about the merge request.  I have [a merge request from four months ago where \"Checking pipeline status\" is still spinning](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/merge_requests/182).  It's now another one of those \"no changes in this merge request\" requests, probably because I submitted *another* merge request for that change and it *didn't* get stuck.\n\nSee [this bug I filed against GitLab](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/gitlab/-/issues/247074) as well as [this bug](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/gitlab/-/issues/214323), and [this epic](https://gitlab.com/groups/gitlab-org/-/epics/4519).",
